: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://api.asm.skype.com/v1/objects/0-cus-d2-e152a0c61f4deedf19d198d016e0f8b5/views/imgpsh_fullsize\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://api.asm.skype.com/v1/objects/0-cus-d2-e152a0c61f4deedf19d198d016e0f8b5/views/imgpsh_fullsize\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Totally harmless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T13:47:36-07:00","id":887465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825315-the-town-that-ran-like-clockwork-demon-actual-play?p=880692#post880692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the answer there is a yes.<br /> <br /> Finally got around to digging up the last piece of art. This little chap is a low Rank Exile named Nestmaker who never did get to make an appearance in the game. Just a quirky little chap who lives in the forest:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.asm.skype.com/v1/objects/0-cus-d2-e152a0c61f4deedf19d198d016e0f8b5/views/imgpsh_fullsize&quot;]</a><img src=\"https://api.asm.skype.com/v1/objects/0-cus-d2-e152a0c61f4deedf19d198d016e0f8b5/views/imgpsh_fullsize\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>[/URL]</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Totally harmless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh sure, its an obvious assumption and probably completely correct, but it could of been something weirder like the kids smacking their cash and prizes against biosynthetic sillacone flesh while she absorbed their stuff like it was lotion or some such- though there are no regular fun bits xD. Angelic/Demonic Form nookie sounds super weird and complicated like that. <br /> <br /> Yup, totally harmless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-10-2016, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}